{"t":"FDXF","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","employees":40000,"hq":"Memphis, TN, United States","website":"https://www.fedexfreight.com","summary_en":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc. provides less-than-truckload freight transportation services in the United States and internationally. The company offers FedEx Freight Priority services, including next-business-day service for shipments traveling up to 600 miles and second-business-day service for shipments traveling up to 1,600 miles and backed by a money-back service guarantee if published delivery commitments are not met; and FedEx Freight Economy. It also provides surface expedite and white glove services; and LTL Select, a cloud-based transportation management system. In addition, the company offers volume and custom critical services, FedEx Freight Direct, and Retail Flex. It provides its services under the FedEx and FedEx Freight names. The company was incorporated in 2025 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc.는 미국 및 국제적으로 트럭 미만 화물 운송 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 최대 600마일까지 이동하는 발송물에 대해 익일 서비스, 최대 1,600마일까지 이동하는 발송물에 대해 영업일 기준 2일 서비스를 포함한 FedEx Freight Priority 서비스를 제공하며, 게시된 배송 약속이 충족되지 않을 경우 환불 서비스를 보장합니다. 및 FedEx 화물 경제. 또한 표면 신속 처리 및 흰 장갑 서비스도 제공합니다. 클라우드 기반 운송 관리 시스템인 LTL Select가 있습니다. 또한 회사는 대량 및 맞춤형 중요 서비스, FedEx Freight Direct 및 Retail Flex를 제공합니다. FedEx 및 FedEx Freight 이름으로 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2025년에 설립되었으며 테네시주 멤피스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":124.41,"mcap":18601940992.0,"pe":37.92988,"fpe":24.157282,"peg":null,"ps":2.1150587,"pb":-74.05357,"ev_ebitda":24.748,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":200.0,"lo52":103.48},"fin":{"rev":8794999808.0,"rev_g":0.081,"eps_g":-0.497,"gross":0.29278,"op":0.1466,"net":0.07447,"roe":0.69093,"fcf":-511124992.0,"cash":388000000.0,"debt":6262000128.0,"de":null,"eps":3.28,"feps":5.15},"own":{"short"